      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e If it lands, we may submit it to Google\u0027s Patch Rewards program, and we\u0027d be glad to share any reward with the maintainers.\n\nDo you have a PoC that this patch is fixing?",
      "revId": "c1134e9f9e6a1e094307e0f4d09e11e16cc6dff8",
